#- §7╔═.✎.════════╗
   §8The Lost Journal
       By Enocori
§7╚════════.✎.═╝

§8J§Jσυɾɳαʅ Eɳƚɾყ 250

§7The date is *§0█/█/█§7* we've finally landed on this Island, desolate and overgrown but promising, a great new beginning. It's nice to
#- §7rest after so much running, we hope we can make some progress this time...

§8Jσυɾɳαʅ Eɳƚɾყ 726

§7Just as I had thought, §0█████ §7took everything from them too, but they seem content? Why don't they care about all that's lost? 
#- §7They've gone about their lives in ignorant bliss... (page torn)

§8Jσυɾɳαʅ Eɳƚɾყ 800

§7I can't 
        tell them 
                   can I? 
They'll 
         think 
               I'm crazy...

     [unintelligible]
#- §8Jσυɾɳαʅ Eɳƚɾყ 866

§7We set up a new lab for our research. I think they said their name was 'Dr Link'? Whatever it is they had better be worth the money it was to set up a lab! It was odd that they insisted it be there though, we only ever used it to discard all that  
#- §7mushroom junk when we first got here, but trust the scientist I guess...

§8Jσυɾɳαʅ Eɳƚɾყ 883

§7The tests failed again, and more died, we can't get enough power into §0█████ §7our only hope of saving us from §0█████
#- §7If it ever shows itself again we need to rebuild, but fewer people are volunteering for the ritual, they know we need this!!!

§8Jσυɾɳαʅ Eɳƚɾყ §0███

§7Crazy!? Is that what they call me after all I've done? 
#- §7I built these roads with my bare hands! 
I raised this company and provided us with security! Everything has been for them! 
To save us! 
Stop laughing! 
stop... laughing... stop 

§5hₐhₐhₐhₐhₐhₐhₐhₐhₐhₐhₐhₐhₐhₐhₐhₐ §7PlEaSe §5hₐhₐhₐhₐ

§7(page torn)
#- §8Jσυɾɳαʅ Eɳƚɾყ §0███

§7If you're reading this I'm sorry, the people I tried to protect are gone, §0█████ §7won. 

I was too blinded by my desire to protect them that I didn't 
even realise that §0█████
§7had followed us... 
#- §7Those voices 
weren't some 'divine intervention' trying to save my people. 

This was the very thing we fled from all those years ago. 

I led my people into §0██████ §7grasp countless times selling their very souls to... §0██████
